note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note The bf16x3 planes of one gathered run of the general GEMM (CUDApp#144, src/omega_gpu_gemm_ex.c run_part, ops 5 and
note 6 of the row unit's numbering): n stored elements of type t, read as words from w, split into three bf16 parts
note (gx_split), become nine planes of round16(n) bf16 elements; plane q of element kk is the 2-byte element q * kp + kk of
note d, four to a little-endian word, zero past n. Plane q takes part (tt >> 4q) & 15, tt the nibble table of op 5 (A')
note or op 6 (B'): Wolfram FromDigits of the C TA/TB reversed, TA {2,2,1,2,1,0,1,0,0} 16851234, TB {2,1,2,0,1,2,0,1,0}
note 270598674. Gives the elements written, 9 * kp.

note p with the 16 bits v in lane kk & 3
fn gx_lane p ulong v ulong kk ulong to ulong
ret or p shl and v 65535 mul and kk 3 16
end

note word g of every plane q whose part is r: v
fn gx_xput tt ulong d edit ulong 8192 kp4 ulong g ulong r ulong v ulong to void
for q ulong 9
if eq and shr tt mul q 4 15 r
put d add mul q kp4 g v
end
end
end

fn gemm_ex_x3 op ulong t ulong n ulong w view ulong 8192 d edit ulong 8192 to ulong
tt = ulong 16851234
if eq op 6
tt = ulong 270598674
end
kp = mul shr add n 15 4 16
p0 = ulong 0
p1 = ulong 0
p2 = ulong 0
for kk ulong kp
s = ulong 0
if lt kk n
s = gx_split bitcast uint gx_ldf t gx_wel view w kk gx_es t
end
p0 = gx_lane p0 s kk
p1 = gx_lane p1 shr s 16 kk
p2 = gx_lane p2 shr s 32 kk
if eq and kk 3 3
gx_xput tt edit d shr kp 2 shr kk 2 0 p0
gx_xput tt edit d shr kp 2 shr kk 2 1 p1
gx_xput tt edit d shr kp 2 shr kk 2 2 p2
p0 = ulong 0
p1 = ulong 0
p2 = ulong 0
end
end
ret mul 9 kp
end
